<title>JAPAN: Yamakawa Industrial - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yamakawa Industrial - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 28.04		vs	   32.42</p>
<p> Operating	  562    million	  vs	    1.38</p>
<p> Current	    734    million	  vs	    1.46</p>
<p> Net		  494    million	  vs	  752    million</p>
<p> EPS		   17.71 yen	  vs	   26.92 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     28 million	  vs	  28 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yamakawa Industrial Co Ltd is a major manufacturer of press-processed car parts.</p>
</text>
